{"id":"n41899-1-7","stage":4,"title":"내륙 · 内陆","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41899-1-7-1","ko":"너 남해안에 가 봤니?","zh":"你去过南海岸吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"남해안에","meaning":"南海岸","explanation":"남해안：南海岸；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"남해안에","audio":"/audio/d11ae8966eefc0d5060d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남해안에","audio":"/audio/d11ae8966eefc0d5060d.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤니","audio":"/audio/f1501c6cd4fb2c2f0d42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/528bcc4ef34b84745965.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41899-1-7-2","ko":"난 내륙에만 살아서 아직 바다를 본 적도 없어.","zh":"我一直住在内陆，从来没见过大海。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"내륙에만","meaning":"内陆","explanation":"내륙：内陆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"내륙","audio":"/audio/49df2f60a8f7a14c3fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41899","senseId":"1","lemma":"내륙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내륙에만","audio":"/audio/eb74f0f2d1a47352767e.mp3"}},{"text":"살아서","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아서","audio":"/audio/f1a340522a2a66762aa6.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"바다를","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다를","audio":"/audio/d4626d297e6e2b27997c.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"적도","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"적：时，时候；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71232","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적도","audio":"/audio/6206cfb30feb3aa62a50.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"49df2f60a8f7a14c","term":"내륙","zh":"内陆","audio":"/audio/49df2f60a8f7a14c3fc0.mp3","entryId":"41899","definition":"远离大海的陆地。","pronunciation":["내ː륙"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"1ea5c356f65344cf","term":"바다","zh":"海，大海，海洋","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3","entryId":"26497","definition":"在地球上除陆地以外被咸水填满的部分。","pronunciation":["바다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/a